=== skill: modify-root-detection ===

# Modify Root Detection

When you need to add support for new monorepo tools or modify workspace boundary detection logic.

## Steps

1. Edit `packages/vite/src/node/server/searchRoot.ts` to add new root detection patterns — update `ROOT_FILES` array with new workspace configuration files
2. Implement new detection function following pattern of `hasWorkspacePackageJSON()` for package.json-based workspaces or `hasRootFile()` for marker files
3. Update `searchForWorkspaceRoot()` function to call your new detection function alongside existing checks
4. Consider order of detection — workspace tools have different precedence and some override others
5. Add comprehensive tests in `packages/vite/src/__tests__/searchRoot.spec.ts` covering various monorepo structures and edge cases
6. Test with real-world monorepo setups to ensure dependency resolution works correctly across workspace boundaries
7. Update documentation if adding support for new monorepo tool — workspace detection affects how Vite resolves imports and dependencies

## Example

Adding support for Bazel workspaces:

```typescript
// In packages/vite/src/node/server/searchRoot.ts

// Add to ROOT_FILES array
const ROOT_FILES = [
  'pnpm-workspace.yaml',
  'lerna.json',
  'WORKSPACE', // Bazel workspace marker
  'WORKSPACE.bazel', // Alternative Bazel workspace file
]

// Add detection function
function hasBazelWorkspace(root: string): boolean {
  return ['WORKSPACE', 'WORKSPACE.bazel'].some(file => 
    fs.existsSync(join(root, file))
  )
}

// Update searchForWorkspaceRoot function
export function searchForWorkspaceRoot(
  current: string,
  root: string = searchForPackageRoot(current),
): string {
  if (hasRootFile(current)) return current
  if (hasWorkspacePackageJSON(current)) return current
  if (hasBazelWorkspace(current)) return current // Add this check

  const dir = dirname(current)
  if (!dir || dir === current) return root
  return searchForWorkspaceRoot(dir, root)
}
```

## References

- `packages/vite/src/node/server/searchRoot.ts` — all workspace detection logic and root finding functions
- `packages/vite/src/__tests__/searchRoot.spec.ts` — test patterns for workspace detection
- `packages/vite/src/node/config.ts` — how detected roots are used in configuration resolution
- `packages/vite/src/node/utils.ts` — path resolution utilities that depend on workspace boundaries
